Chatterbox — MLX Swift port
===========================

This directory is a Swift/MLX port of Resemble AI's Chatterbox TTS model.
It contains code under two separate copyrights; both notices below apply.


1. Chatterbox
-------------

Upstream project: https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox

