2. Kokoro Swift — applies to S3Gen/HiFiGAN/HiFiGAN.swift
--------------------------------------------------------

The signal-processing and building-block helpers in
S3Gen/HiFiGAN/HiFiGAN.swift (interpolate, interpolate1d, unwrap, mlxStft,
mlxIstft, MLXSTFT, InstanceNorm1d, ConvWeighted, weightNorm,
ReflectionPad1d, Upsample, SineGen, SourceModuleHnNSF) are adapted from the
Kokoro Swift implementation also vendored at Sources/Models/Kokoro/.

Upstream project: https://github.com/mlalma/kokoro-ios

